  "description": "The chart engine of ExChart: series in the data's own terms, each with its Series Kind, drawn as what it is — levels joined only to their neighbours, rates and amounts as steps with open and filled ends — on proportional or category axes, thinned past the plot's pixels, laid out as an immutable scene, and written as CSV. No UI, and no dependency but the family's data.",
